Package: kylin-wayland-compositor
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
Replaces: kylin-wayland-compositor-tools (<< 1.3.1-ok34)
Breaks: kylin-wayland-compositor-effects
Description: Kylin wayland compositor
 kylin-wayland-compositor is the window manager based on wlroots.
 It gives you complete control over your windows. It paints the
 window decoration, the bar on top of window with buttons like
 close, maximize and minimize. It also handles placing of windows
 and switching between them.

